<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    RUT_Miasma                                     UtinniPatches - authored 2026-09-09
    BIOME_OWNERSHIP_WAVE_1. Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/
    the_miasma.md (FROZEN). Replaces the donor `AB_MiasmicMangrove` (Alpha Biomes).

    MEASURED (sheet SS0): 93 tiles strung along the Salt Gate (the Grey Sea's
    deltas). Elevation median 22 m, the lowest ground on the dayside; 32 river
    tiles, 6 sea tiles; temp median 42.8 C. Rain: zero on 89 of 93 tiles — "the
    delta itself has never once been rained on" (the donor's Rain/RainyThunderstorm
    commonalities are kept anyway, see below, because the biome's own SS3 breath-tide
    mechanism reads them as SEA SURGE, not sky rain).

    animalDensity/movementDifficulty/diseaseMtbDays kept at the donor's own values:
    sheet SS0 explicitly names all three as "kept and explained" — 6.5 is refugee
    crowding (SS3 "the lifeboat"), 4 is the root-maze and muck, 15 is "the Working's
    failures leaking out" (SS4b, fever-forged).

    Weather: ban 5 ("No rain — the swamp is fed by river and sea only") is read
    here as banning RAIN AS THE WATER SOURCE, not the WeatherDef slot itself — the
    donor's own Rain/RainyThunderstorm/FoggyRain commonalities are kept as the
    mechanical stand-in for the surge/breath-tide (SS3, "when the terminator storms
    pile the Grey Sea against the Salt Gate shore, the sea surges") pending a real
    surge WeatherDef (SS Owed, `MIASMA_MECHANICS_1`) — flagged, not silently
    invented. Snow zeroed (42.8 C median).

    diseases: the three Alpha Biomes-specific entries (BacterialGangrene/
    ViralAbasia/RavagingIntestinalParasites) kept MayRequire-gated — these ARE
    "the Working's failures" (SS3/SS4b), i.e. the sheet's own central mechanism, not
    generic dressing.

    wildAnimals/wildPlants: transplanted from BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml /
    BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml against rosters/the_miasma.json.

    NOT this pass's scope: `MIASMA_MECHANICS_1` (surge/salt-line system, fever-forged
    boon tables, warden-mother set-piece placement); the attar refinement chain; any
    world repaint.

    MIASMA_NURSERY_KINDS_1 (2026-09-10): the nursery-band RSW_* entries below spawn
    the *Juv defNames (SWBestiary SeaBeasts_NurseryJuveniles.xml (moved 2026-09-11: cross-mod ParentName inheritance is unsupported, defs now live beside their parents)), not the base
    species: those are juvenile-locked (lifeStageAges dropped below AnimalAdult, so
    LifeStageUtility caps them at Juvenile forever regardless of rolled age). The
    Grey Sea/terminator roster keeps the un-capped base defNames for the adults.

  -->

  <BiomeDef>
    <defName>RUT_Miasma</defName>
    <label>the Miasma</label>
    <description>A salt-crusted, stilt-rooted mangal forest standing in brackish channels between a dying sea and the rivers that feed it, under a green-gold haze of its own breath. Walking is hard, the air hangs thick, and the water crowds with life -- because everything ends up here: the water, the sins it carries, and the life running from the salt. Threaded through the stink, improbably, beauty: rainbow-hued plants, young animals everywhere, and the stubborn sense the place is on the verge of something.</description>
    <workerClass>AlphaBiomes.BiomeWorker_MiasmicMangrove</workerClass>
    <foragedFood>RawBerries</foragedFood>
    <allowRoads>true</allowRoads>
    <allowRivers>true</allowRivers>
    <allowFarmingCamps>true</allowFarmingCamps>
    <animalDensity>6.5</animalDensity>
    <plantDensity>0.7</plantDensity>
    <forageability>1.0</forageability>
    <movementDifficulty>4</movementDifficulty>
    <texture>Biomes/AB_MiasmicMangrove</texture>
    <diseaseMtbDays>15</diseaseMtbDays>
    <diseases>
      <li MayRequire="sarg.alphabiomes">
        <diseaseInc>AB_Disease_BacterialGangrene</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li MayRequire="sarg.alphabiomes">
        <diseaseInc>AB_Disease_ViralAbasia</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li MayRequire="sarg.alphabiomes">
        <diseaseInc>AB_Disease_RavagingIntestinalParasites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Malaria</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>160</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_SleepingSickness</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>140</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Flu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Plague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_GutWorms</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_MuscleParasites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
    </diseases>
    <terrainsByFertility>
      <li>
        <terrain>Mud</terrain>
        <min>-999</min>
        <max>0.65</max>
      </li>
      <li>
        <terrain>AB_FertileMud</terrain>
        <min>0.65</min>
        <max>999</max>
      </li>
    </terrainsByFertility>
    <baseWeatherCommonalities>
      <Clear>8</Clear>
      <Fog>5</Fog>
      <Rain>10</Rain>
      <DryThunderstorm>0.9</DryThunderstorm>
      <RainyThunderstorm>5</RainyThunderstorm>
      <FoggyRain>4</FoggyRain>
      <SnowGentle>0</SnowGentle>
      <SnowHard>0</SnowHard>
    </baseWeatherCommonalities>
    <wildAnimals>
